Use the exact reference.uri for every requested prepared image, descriptive alt text, and the supplied attribution/license/source. Generated images MUST have a visible caption identifying them as AI-generated illustrations with the recorded model; never describe them as archival photographs or documentary evidence. Preserve existing prose except as requested. Do not invent image URLs or claim an image was saved if it is not in this manifest.

Before returning, check that all before ranges are disjoint in the original document. If replacing an image and inserting another image beside it, combine both operations into one replacement for that source region. Do not also emit the image-only replacement as a second edit; an insertion anchor must not overlap another edit.
